      "name": "Civil Certificated Rates",
      "description": {
        "content": "This endpoint provides the Legal Aid civil certificated rates, which are the prescribed reimbursement rates for legal services provided under the Legal Aid Scheme.\n\n[Support Link](https://help.clio.com/hc/en-150/sections/9591010772379-Legal-Aid)\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
